  "notes": "FORMS:\n{暗|あん} (dark, secret) + {殺|さつ} (kill). Literally \"secret killing.\"\n\nUSAGE:\nSpecifically refers to the murder of prominent figures (politicians, leaders, public figures) for political or ideological reasons. Does not apply to ordinary murders.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {暗殺|あんさつ}する: to assassinate\n- {暗殺|あんさつ}{未遂|みすい}: attempted assassination\n- {暗殺|あんさつ}{事件|じけん}: assassination incident\n- {暗殺|あんさつ}{者|しゃ}: assassin\n- {暗殺|あんさつ}{計画|けいかく}: assassination plot\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {暗殺|あんさつ}: assassination (political murder)\n- {殺人|さつじん}: murder, homicide (general)\n- {謀殺|ぼうさつ}: premeditated murder (legal term)",
